      "alt": "MBa6ULx board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on MBa6ULxL for a cost-effective and small solution platform</h1>\n<p>The Embedded BoxPC ABox-6ULxL is an ideal platform for embedded computing engineers, offering a cost-effective and compact solution for various applications. Based on the TQMa6ULxL, it features an extended temperature range, low power consumption (typically 2-3 W), and modular expandability. This Box PC provides a wide voltage input range, 2x CAN interfaces with galvanic isolation, and 2x Ethernet ports. It serves as both a gateway and a data logger, making it versatile for industrial applications. With a variety of interfaces and the power of Arm Cortex-A7 technology, it's well-suited for tasks requiring fast and secure data processing with minimal energy consumption.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 17:42:53 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
